WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.720
A plugin is a saved set of instructions that turns a chatbot into a helper for one job,

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:09.320
like making exit tickets. The plugin section shows how to build one,

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:13.300
and how to rent or sell it. There is no promise of sales.
